# ── Generated review artefacts ────────────────────────────────────────────
# The full-resolution page captures (225 MB) and the review set (21 MB) are
# working files for showing the site to people. They are regenerated with
#   node tools/capture-pages.mjs
#   python3 tools/build-review-set.py
# and are delivered separately as a handover folder, not as repository files.
docs/mockups/
docs/review-set/

# ── Un-optimised image masters ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Working files for the media pipeline. The optimised images in
# public/media/ are what the site ships; the masters are not site assets.
tools/media/_masters/
